            "review_title": "Review at Chuc Linh",
            "review_text": "org17\nJoshua Tree, California993 contributions\n0\nAuthentic and delicious, but take your time..\nDec 2022 • Couples\nWith large portions of authentic local food, we really enjoyed our dinner here. The hosting family is very kind and friendly, and the prices are cheap. The only thing to be aware of is that everything is cooked on a single stove at the end of the dining area. The upside is that you get to see how fresh your food is, but you also have to wait for all dishes of all customers to be cooked one after the other. With an almost empty place, our dishes arrived 25-45 minutes after we ordered them. So patience is required here…\nRead more\nWritten December 9, 2022",
            "rating": 5.0,
