            "review_text": "philguk\nRamsey, United Kingdom341 contributions\n0\nGreat food - vast quantities!!\nNov 2022 • Couples\nCalled in here as we wanted a Vietnamese lunch but somewhere that had easily understandable English menus!\n\nNot much English was spoken but no problems in ordering. Well, one problem was that we were not prepared for the sizes of the portions. We certainly didn’t leave hungry\n\nIt was also great actually watching our food be cooked. Really really tasty too\nRead more\nWritten November 1, 2022",
