            "review_text": "April B\n2 contributions\n0\nnice food and friendly staff/owner\nMar 2014 • Couples\nDiscovered this hidden treasure while roaming around the old quarter, looking for a non busy and authentic vietnamese resto. The old lady was very nice and was smiling all the time. Their food is delicious and it is priced well. We stayed at Hanoi for 5 days and we went here 4 times. I was addicted to their baguette!\nValue\nService\nFood\nAtmosphere\nReview collected in partnership with this restaurant \nWritten February 26, 2015",
