            "review_title": "Review at Chuc Linh",
            "review_text": "Martijn O\nAmsterdam36 contributions\n0\nExcellent place for true Vietnamese food (and delicious pastries)\nDec 2012 • Couples\nWe stayed for 2 weeks in Hanoi, and probably came back here 4 or 5 times. Excellent quality Vietnamese food for a very decent price. All the ingredients are fresh and the food is prepared on the spot. That's also why it may take a while before the food arrives on the table, so don't go here if you are in a hurry.\nThe owner also sells some excellent pastries\nWritten January 20, 2013",
